  "notes": "Dragon Adventures is a dragon-taming RPG from Sonar Studios. You find and hatch eggs, raise baby dragons into adults, and ride them around several open worlds while collecting food and resources. There are more than 200 dragon species to discover, and you can build your own lair to keep them in, fight enemies, and fly or run across each map.\n\nMost codes give potions, food, coins or event items, and they usually only last about a week. The five working right now are YouTuber codes that each give a preset potion, which recolors a dragon in that creator's color style, and these do not expire. Use them on a dragon you plan to keep. New limited codes usually come from Sonar Studios on X and Instagram during events, birthdays and big updates.",
