  "faq": [
    {
      "q": "Where did the Gift Codes button go in Dragon Adventures?",
      "a": "In November 2025 the Gift Codes tab was renamed to Rewards. You can open it from the Menu or from the Rewards button on the right side of the screen."
    },
    {
      "q": "Are Dragon Adventures codes case-sensitive?",
      "a": "No, the game accepts codes in any mix of capital and lowercase letters. Each code still only works once per account."
    },
    {
      "q": "Why do so many Dragon Adventures codes stop working fast?",
      "a": "Event and milestone codes from Sonar Studios normally expire after about a week. Only the content creator preset potion codes stay active long term, so redeem event codes as soon as you see them."
    }
  ],
